defer-moves-binding.slp:8:19: error[SL0300]: cannot move `message` inside a `defer`
  |
 8 |   (defer (consume message))
  |                   ^^^^^^^
  = label 7:3: value was declared here
  = help: a deferred expression runs before the scope releases what it owns, so the value has to still be there; borrow it or `clone` it
